# Device reconciliation with main incl. feat-ui-panel (Wave 4) (2026-10-07). main at bfb90f4. Firmware: firmware/build.sh (patches 05, 10, 11, 12, 20, 21, 22) then firmware/flash.sh under the device lock; stack: weixue/xiaozhi-esp32-server:local rebuilt from server/overlay (running container differed in weixue_patches.py and weixue_proactive.py).
# Capture 2026-10-07T04:49:20Z UTC, serial from RTS reset, 120 s. Events (UTC): say Jarvis 04:50:10; say "What time is it?" 04:50:14; capture end 04:51:20. Mac volume 55. Redacted: SSID, BSSID, MACs, client ids, MCP token URL.
# Two earlier rounds on the same build (capture 04:44:56 and 04:47:14, question said 9 s after Jarvis) missed the 8 s follow-up window: websocket closed from idle at 61 s, no question reached the server. Not included.
# Server log times are UTC-7 (21:50 = 04:50 UTC).

